OL,3,GNEWSAMan taken to hospital after being
OL,4,Ahit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been taken to hospital after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car in Nottingham.
OL,9,FPolice said part of Wilkinson Street
OL,10,Fwould be closed for some time after the
OL,11,Fincident, which happened at 14:45 BST
OL,12,Fon Thursday.
OL,14,FIn a social media post at about 16:00,
OL,15,Ftraffic control centre Nottingham
OL,16,FTravelwise said the road was shut
OL,17,Fbetween Armstrong Way and Heslington
OL,18,FAvenue.
OL,20,FDrivers have been advised to avoid the
OL,21,Farea.
